        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/sheep/scene_sheep.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 71d833e8-5f8d-4cd5-8dc8-48d5097f71e9).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, agent. This is Eclipse speaking.\r\rDue to the new access to Ambrose Island, I have found my new signature weapon: The Kukri Machete (which btw, is unlocked at level 3 mastery). I&apos;ve decided to make a contract series out of this new weapon I&apos;ve started to love.\r\rAfter you kill each target, you will say a phrase, which changes for each contract. Today&apos;s is, &quot;GET KUKRID, BITCH!&quot;, as in the past tense of the act of killing someone with a Kukri, if that makes sense.\r\rRegardless, good luck.",
